--cpp20
^\[__invoke\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ two-parameter operator\(\) selected: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
